{"version":1,"content":"<p>英特爾近日在美國芝加哥舉行的SC26超級計算大會上首次公開展示其GPU D270加速器的詳細性能數據。這款產品此前代號為「Crescent Island」，與傳統顯卡不同，它並不具備圖形渲染能力，也沒有面向遊戲的3D圖形和光線追蹤硬件，而是將更多資源專門用於人工智能、高性能計算和科學研究任務。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587148.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T17:01:01.090509+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:54:09.485448+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:54:09.485448+00:00","content_hash":"342a18fbed9ea66eb6208c19c3319db02e7a6c226448f0799322c1d439fa48e3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}